## 1. Privacy Guarantees & Non-Negotiables

- **Zero Unauthorized Telemetry**: No background telemetry, analytics tracking, or behavioral profiling without user opt-in.
- **Local Data Ownership**: User data remains under the user's sovereign control on local storage.
- **Third-Party Boundary**: No third-party network egress or external service calls unless explicitly confirmed by user decision.

